  (global_label "RO_OUT" (shape passive) (at 361.95 177.8 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid 333b3a8f-23b2-4f5d-babb-42c7ddbf16ab) (property "Intersheetrefs" "${INTERSHEET_REFS}" (at 361.95 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)))
  (text "RF: 18 non-magnetic SMP jacks (Amphenol RF SMP-MSLD-PCS-NM); J11 is the DC micro-D, so J1-J10, J12-J19" (at 287.02 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid ba444bea-95a9-495f-8229-5a2b50a25656))
  (text "Fast flux lines = 8 differential pairs <name>_P / <name>_N, one 50-ohm coax per leg (Z_odd 50, Z_diff 100)" (at 287.02 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid e656f131-95fb-41a5-a5a0-9c09f619790d))
  (text "Intra-pair skew <= 0.10 mm; A/B partner pairs matched <= 0.20 mm (reports/length_report.txt)" (at 287.02 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid a5334851-4b61-4963-a436-6f2d9df7b11b))
  (text "H1-H4: M2.5 plated mounting holes to the Cu sample-holder base (GND)" (at 299.72 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9d9eefed-db6f-4179-9688-3273130d9ba7))
  (text "DESIGN NOTES" (at 17.78 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 57f5ba21-6c54-4d73-b0f3-0a5c8721a17d))
  (text "1. Gate lines GATE_BS*: static gate voltages. 2-stage RC ladder R1 = R2 = 10 kOhm, C1 = C2 = 10 nF C0G: H(s) = 1/(1 + s(R1C1 + R2C2 + R1C2) + s^2 R1C1R2C2) -> f(-3 dB) = 596 Hz (limit <= 10 kHz)." (at 17.78 251.968 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 01a85542-e850-4610-be22-0be927c88c06))
  (text "2. Load lines LOAD_*: flux ramp 0 -> Phi0 in ~1 us into a 1 nH load loop shorted on chip (current drive). Tee R1 = R2 = 1.0 kOhm, C = 18 pF: I/V = 1/(R1 + R2 + sC R1 R2) -> f(-3 dB) = 1/(2 pi C R1||R2) = 17.7 MHz (target 10-20 MHz);" (at 17.78 255.016 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid b7b54e52-661a-4e24-a22e-543ab8cd12e4))
  (text "   into a high-impedance load 1/(2 pi R1 C) = 8.84 MHz. Both pass the 1 us ramp (bandwidth >= 5 MHz; tau = 9.0 ns)." (at 17.78 258.064 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 15be55fb-909c-4f95-9366-2948dadd0106))
  (text "3. Parts for 10 mK: thin-film non-magnetic resistors (Vishay PNM), C0G/NP0 non-magnetic MLCC (Vishay VJ Non-Magnetic, Cu barrier), non-magnetic SMP. No ferrite, no X7R, no Ni-barrier terminations." (at 17.78 261.112 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid aea06239-8907-4b60-a206-c08278bc2875))
  (text "4. RF lines are DC-coupled, no on-board components on RF nets. Rev B: each fast flux line is a differential pair <name>_P / <name>_N = the two ends of ONE floating on-chip loop (no ground return), driven by complementary AWG outputs," (at 17.78 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 007b2fed-58d5-460a-a37d-38af330be1cc))
  (text "   one 50-ohm coax per leg: loosely coupled edge-coupled GCPW, Z_odd 50 ohm (Z_diff 100 ohm), Z_even close to 50 ohm; intra-pair skew <= 0.10 mm (~0.5 ps). KiCad recognises the _P / _N suffix as a differential pair." (at 17.78 267.208 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9b7f291d-605d-4a15-8763-9173de10747d))
  (text "5. Net names = circuits/die_pads.json (rev B, 32 pads). Generated by pcb/build_carrier.py from pcb/carrier_params.py - edit the parameters, not this sheet." (at 17.78 270.256 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid aa56f8ca-1cf1-4695-994d-b3095d67f808))
